### Owner updates -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8083/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Java Microservices Developer",
  "location": "Toronto, ON",
  "jobType": "FULL_TIME",
  "minSalary": 110000,
  "maxSalary": 150000,
  "description": "Build microservices with Java, Spring Boot and Kafka. 5+ years.",
  "remote": true,
  "requiredSkills": ["Java", "Spring", "Kafka"]
}

### Not the owner -> 403
PUT http://localhost:8083/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hacked",
  "location": "Nowhere",
  "jobType": "FULL_TIME",
  "minSalary": 1,
  "maxSalary": 2,
  "description": "x",
  "remote": true
}